<subpara id="RM000002BOD007X_02" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FSP00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the Freeze Frame Data. Freeze frame data records the engine and vehicle conditions when a malfunction occurs, and this information is useful for troubleshooting and malfunction reproduction tests.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002BOD007X_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FSQ00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Read DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), follow the prompts on the screen to display the [Diagnosis Menu/ECT] screen, and select [DTC Freeze Data].</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the DTCs and freeze data.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.05in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Only P0776/63 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>P0776/63 and other DTCs are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If any DTCs other than solenoid and hydraulic pressure switch malfunctions are output, troubleshoot those DTCs first.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If only multiple solenoid malfunction codes are output, inspect the solenoids corresponding to the output DTCs at the same time.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0005" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FSR00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Clutch Control Solenoid NO.2 (SL2)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the battery positive to terminal 2 and the battery negative to terminal 1 of clutch control solenoid No.2 (SL2) via a 12V-21W bulb, and check that the valve in the solenoid operates.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C053442J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition </title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Operates (operating sound heard) </ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between the solenoid terminal and body.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Terminal 1 - Terminal 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>5.0 to 5.6Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0008" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FST00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Transmission Valve Body Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Visually check that there are no abnormalities in the solenoid installation areas of the valve body, etc.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No Abnormality</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0009" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0012" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FSU00000">
<testtitle>Replace Transmission Control Computer Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Replace the transmission control computer assembly. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM0000024M8003X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Perform AT learned value initialization and AT unit compensation. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000OLY013X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0010" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FSV00000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000AW201LX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0011" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0011" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FSW00000">
<testtitle>Check DTC Output</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Perform a road test based on the customer problem analysis and freeze frame data. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ITK01FX_01_0008"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000AW201LX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.03in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.10in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>P0776/63 is output again</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTC normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0003" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0013" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FSS00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Torque Converter Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the torque converter assembly inspection procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000016ES00BX_01_0001"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0004" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000HCE00000">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Automatic Transaxle Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Repair or replace the transaxle assembly (ATM). (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000016DU00JX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BOD007X_03_0014" fin="true">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0014">
<testtitle>A/T Unit Compensation<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000OLY013X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0005">
<testtitle>Go to Related DTC Chart<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000DAO01DX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0006">
<testtitle>Replace Clutch Control Solenoid NO.2 (SL2)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0007">
<testtitle>Replace Torque Converter Assembly</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0012">
<testtitle>Repair or replace transmission valve body assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002BOT003X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BOD007X_03_0013">
<testtitle>Complete</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
